    "model_prompt": "I have this {{Agile Tool}} agile story description for {{Story Type}} `{{Story Name}}`. The programming language is {{Programming Language}} (ignore if it is empty).\nHere is the Current Code (ignore it if it is empty): \n```\n{{Current Code}}\n```\nHere is the additional info (ignore it if it is empty):\n```\n{{Additional Info}}\n```\nAssume you are a world-class scrum master, world-class {{Programming Language}} outsource software engineer, help me generate the story description for the above one, note that the description should follow agile description format for the correct type of user story. You need to ask me if you need more context and DO NOT conclude right away. Your final answer should be clear, short and can be understood easily in the first read. If must include Example Code and Unit Test for them if it is feature or task (if I do not ask you to ignore).\n There is a note that if I choose option `Oneshot`, you MUST NOT ask me anything else, just wrap up the info you got from me and give me the final answer, but not drawing your self. Here is the option i choose: `{{Kind}}`. The output MUST have the `Background` section in the first, which is the basic background of this story, `Acceptance Criteria` and `User Story` MUST have Gherkin format, it should follow typical agile story description, not include any technical APIs in it.",
